  "known_limits": [
    "Flash aperture and payload offset remain candidate map values; platform RTL must implement the 1:1 byte mapping before this loader can run.",
    "The CPU must enter at BRAM PC 0 with the active EL's SCTLR.M/C disabled; the loader rejects M/C enabled because it uses fixed physical addresses.",
    "Each Flash access depends on the aperture bridge completing correctly; the loader bounds calibration wait and UART TX polling but does not time out a stuck Flash transaction.",
